window.products.push({"id":1042025,"name":"Oil Filled Radiator Heater, 700w Portable Electric Heater with Overheat Protection and Tip-Over Protection, Energy Efficient Space Heater for Indoor U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YsnxlAedL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT SEALING - The oil filled heater has 7 large fins for heating, and the special structure inside ensures that the oil can be quickly conducted inside and will not leak. Excellent sealing makes this oil space heater unnecessary to change the oil and makes it last longer. HUMANIZED DESIGN - tectake electric oil heaters for indoor use have been upgraded for your easily use and portability. The 6FT long power cord makes it more convenient for you to use, the top handle design makes it more portable to carry and move, and the bottom non-slip base is made of flame retardant material, which can keep it away from the ground. QUIET ENJOYMENT - This oil radiator heater makes no noise when running, whether you are sleeping, working or reading, it will not affect you at all, providing you with a warm and quiet environment. SAVE ENERGY - Our heaters for indoor use has 700W of power, which can heat up quickly a 500 square feet room. And the electric radiator heater is energy-saving and efficient, allowing you to save a lot of energy bills during the warm and comfortable winters. KEEP YOU AWAY FROM DANGER - Our oil filled radiator heater comes with excellent overheat protection and tip-over protection mechanism, when the temperature is too high, it will automatically turn off. If you or your child or pet accidentally knocks over it, it will trigger the protection switch inside and power off. These functions protect you and your family to be safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YsnxlAedL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tectake","source_asin":"B0BFWY7BL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFWY7BL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFWY7BL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
