window.products.push({"id":1042125,"name":"WeiYang 3 Pieces Wall Art Pictures for Living Room Bedroom African American Canvas Painting Black and Gold Woman Posters Prints Artwork Pretty Girl Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wXPC-aiyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Material: Canvas and Wood. Wall decor: Picture is already perfectly stretched on thick wooden frame.The side margins are also printed to create a particularly decorative effect.Canvas Wall Art is the modern way to brighten the walls of your home, and relax you after work. Perfect gift: This is Thanksgiving,Halloween,Christmas,Valentine's Day to relatives, friends,lover,colleagues and neighbors of the best gifts. Giclee Print: 1. For giclee printing, the paper or substrate used to actually print the final piece must be acid free and consists of a 100% cotton base.2. Any image that is to be printed as a giclee needs to be created at a resolution of no less than 300 dots per inch (DPI). This is to ensure that the final print has the sharpest detail and lacks any of the fragmentation that can occur with images less than 300 DPI. 3. The last step to creating or confirming a true giclee print is the type of ink and printer used. The biggest contrast between a standard inkjet print and a giclee print is that giclees are printed using pigment-based inks rather than the dye-based inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last anywhere from 100 to 208 years without significant fading. NOTE: Your paintings will be carefully packaged in bubble weap and cardboard to ensure they reach you in perfect condition.If you have any questions, please contact us by email!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wXPC-aiyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEIYANG","source_asin":"B08KZNMZ5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZNMZ5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZNMZ5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
