window.products.push({"id":1042143,"name":"ECR4Kids Scoop-Front Storage Bins, Easy-to-Grip Design Storage Cubbies, Kid Friendly and Built to Last, Pairs with ECR4Kids Storage Units, 10-Pack, Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r2xK9yUEL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you are a preschool manager, a school administrator, a teacher, or just a concerned parent looking for durable, safe, and convenient storage bins, ECR4Kids offers an affordable solution. For people looking to get organized, these handy Scoop-Front Storage Bins are an exceptional solution. The ECR4Kids Scoop-Front Storage Bins are built out of a sturdy plastic that stands up to daily wear and tear. Each bin is kid-friendly and features a protruding lip and scoop front that make it easy to pick up and carry. They are made of a durable polypropylene material that stands up to everyday use, and they are incredibly easy to clean. Our toy bins can be used for standalone storage, pair well with ECR4Kids Birch Storage, and fit in most 12-inch cubbies. When empty, the bins can be stacked easily for convenient storage and transportation. This 10-pack of storage bins is not just for kids. They are perfect for use in storage shed for tools, in the kitchen, pantry or bathroom for cleaning supplies, bathroom products, and toiletries, in the medicine drawer for vitamins, inside cupboards and drawers to sort smaller items, and in dorm rooms, RVs, offices, nurseries, and more. The ECR4Kids Scoop-Front Storage Bins feature easy-to-grasp scoop handles and can easily store and organize toys, games, puzzles, art supplies, and more. They come in a pack of 10 and can be stacked. They are available in a variety of colors to suit any environment Including clear, emerald, red, white, navy, green and much more. The bins measure 5.3\" H x 8\" W x 11.8\" D, and the interior base measures 6″ W × 9.5″ D. ECR4Kids is committed to enhancing education in the classroom and at home. We specialize in a wide range of high-quality educational furniture and supplies. We’re your partner for pre-K and beyond.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r2xK9yUEL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECR4Kids","source_asin":"B07CHXKB9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHXKB9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHXKB9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
