window.products.push({"id":1042149,"name":"Cieltown Weighted Blanket for Adult Woman and Man (Dark Gray Blanket, 48\"x72\" 15lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JRZm4BmsL._AC_SL1364_.jpg","description":"BOTH PREMIUM WEIGHTED BLANKET and MATCHED COVER ARE AVAILABLE IN OUR STORE, PURCHASE TOGETHER TO HAVE A DISCOUNT. RECOMMENDED WEIGHT/SIZE The weight of the blanket you order should be 7%-13% of your weight, which would make the most of the blanket. Due to its weight, it’s not necessary to choose oversized blanket. Recommend 48'' x 72'' for twin bed, 60'' x 80'' for queen bed. ABOUT WASHING Our weighted blankets are machine washable, But we don't recommend machine wash because it's too heavy and We're afraid it might damage your washing machine. The best way for you to use it with a duvet cover, then you can just take the cover off for a quick wash and dry. Don't wash the blankets directly. PREMIUM MATERIAL The weighted blanket is made of 100% breathable natural cotton, which would make it cooler and more durable than normal blanket. The filling is environmental non-glue polyester padding and Hypo-allergenic,non-toxic,odorless Glass Beads. NEW PROCESS We improved our technology step by step. The new process can make the square much smaller, which would make weight distributed evenly inside the blanket. The updated process would fix the problem that the glass beads move massive around inside the blanket. To prevent the glass beads leakage, we add two layer microfiber inside, which is also breathable and would not make it hot. REMINDER Some people are not recommended to use the weighted blanket. Physically weak people do not recommend using this blanket, Or choose lighter weight blanket. Pregnant women, babies and sick patient are prohibited to use. Please do not use it for children under 5 years old.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JRZm4BmsL._AC_SL1364_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cieltown","source_asin":"B07L79FGDZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L79FGDZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L79FGDZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1042150,"name":"Love Uk Cotton Linen Pillow Cover- 18x18\" Cushion Cover- Throw Pillow Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALgH-x5-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: 1pc pillow cover. ( cushion insert isn't included) Size: 18 x 18 (45x45 cm) Material: cotton linen fabric color: line nature color printed design pattern. The design pattern is only print on the front side,the back of this pillow is the nature linen color without printing. This pillow cover is made of fine medium weight kona cotton fabric, hidden zipper closure is easy insertion/removal of an insert. Wash in cold water at gentle cycle or by hand. Do not use bleach. These pillow covers are handmade, there may be 1-2cm deviation exist. Color maybe slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness or wariations between the computer monitors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALgH-x5-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillow Cover","source_asin":"B00U3EFU94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U3EFU94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U3EFU94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1042151,"name":"Dyna-Glo RMC-95C6B Indoor Kerosene Convection Heater, 23000 BTU, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QmG8t+mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ideal choice for indoor safe supplemental heating. These heaters are great for use in your home, basement, garage, or at the cabin. Because these heaters do not require electricity to operate (batteries included), they make an excellent choice for both everyday zone heating as well as for emergency situations when the power goes out. Indoor kerosene heaters use ONLY 1 K kerosene, burn with 99.9% efficiency, and operate with a push button on and off design. Dependable - Ideal for emergency use or daily use Economical - Cut heating bills by warming only occupied areas Convenient - Easy to use automatic ignition and one-touch shut-off Safe - Built-in safety switch shuts power off if unit is knocked over Versatile - Use in workshops, basements, cottages, RVs, and more Extended Comfort - Operates up to 11 hours on one full tank of kerosene","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QmG8t+mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyna-Glo","source_asin":"B00NEG7Q9A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NEG7Q9A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NEG7Q9A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
