window.products.push({"id":1042277,"name":"Houseables Baseball Stand, Display Holder, 12 Pack, Clear, 1.6” D x ½ H, 1 5/8”, Acrylic, Softball Displays, Baseballs Ring, Stone Egg Stands, Round P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gWy2pW9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECTLY SIZED RINGS: Lightweight round beveled ball display rings. Each of the 12 piece sets comes in at 1.6” D x ½ H, 1 5/8”, perfect to display of a variety of balls, ornaments, and collectibles. Clear injected molded acrylic with smooth edges and a sleek polished finish (smooth to the touch with no splintering or roughness). SPORTS COLLECTIBLES, POTTERY, AND MORE: Display stand for miniature and regulation sized soccer balls, volleyballs, basketballs, bowling balls, golf balls, tennis balls, hand balls, soft balls, marbles, dragon balls, eggs, crystal spheres, glass ornaments, miniature cannon balls, and many other spherically shaped collectibles and accessories. Useful for showcasing pottery bowls and other handmade ceramic art at exhibits, galleries, and gift shops. ENHANCES ALL OBJECTS THAT IT HOLDS: A favorite for hobbyists in the dying industry of hobby shops and pawn shops. The transparency of these ring displays won’t take away focus from your displayed items, rather only highlighting them whether inside of a glass case or on a mantle. These rings will remain stationary on any flat surface, from bookshelves to display cases HIGH IMPACT ACRYLIC SUPPORTS A LOT OF WEIGHT: Don’t be fooled by the modest look and design of these rings -- they are able to support heavier, more rotund items without those items tipping over or rolling off from the ring when being bumped into. The high-impact plastic will not crack or scuff up easily. Shatter resistant plastic allows the rings to come into contact with the ground and not break. PROTECT YOUR COLLECTIBLES: The gentle material of our baseball holders will ensure no scratches come to any of your worldly collectibles and possessions. They'll be in great hands for all to admire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gWy2pW9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houseables","source_asin":"B075GH99T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075GH99T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075GH99T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
