window.products.push({"id":1042485,"name":"Solar Cooking Double or Triple Broiler pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418vZPbPhZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cooking 2 or 3 quart pots in your solar cooker allows you to cook two to three different items at once. Put a soup in the bottom, bratwurst in the middle and corn bread in the top pot. It is the perfect way to increase the amount of food you can get out of your solar cooker at one time. These pots are designed to nest perfectly. The lid fits on perfectly too. To cook put your food in the pots. Put the longer cooking foods in the bottom pots and your faster cooking item in the top pot. The bottom and the top pot will heat up the fastest. The middle pot will heat up slower. After 1 hour all pots will be very close in temperature. For best results put your food 2/3 of the way to the top of the pot. Add next pot and do the same, add next pot and do the same. Add the lid. Make sure to use a turkey roasting bag around the 2 or 3 pots. This forms a green house and keeps the heat in so it cooks faster. Double your fun if your solar cooker is large and you can cook 6 pots of food. 2 sets of 3 pots stacked side by side. Then you want to check your food open the bag and take off the lid with a hot pot holder. Remove top pot to check the food below it. then remove the next pot to see the bottom pot. Cooking like this is amazing. Not only is it more efficient, it is more fun. Experiment and learn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418vZPbPhZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dr. Soltice Double or Triple Broiler Pan","source_asin":"B075RWXR1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075RWXR1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075RWXR1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
