window.products.push({"id":1042503,"name":"WHARPH Premium Meat Tenderizer - Manual Hand Held Heavy Duty and Dishwasher Safe 48-blade Stainless Steel Razor Pin Press Kitchen Tool -Great for Tend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ClbILpMML._AC_SL1491_.jpg","description":"Having a tender, juicy and delicious prime steak at a restaurant, have you ever wondered how you can make it yourself at home without losing the quality and spending too much money on an expensive cut of meat? With our WHARPH Premium 48-Blade Meat Tenderizer, it is absolutely possible to create a restaurant quality dish! How Does It Work? -designed to turn any piece of meat into prime, tender, delicious cut with 48 razor sharp ultra-thin stainless steel blades tenderizing through tough connective tissue, making tiny incisions without mushing the meat, and allowing sauce and spices to penetrate quickly; What Does It Offer? -Comfortable grip non-slip handle allows for a better motion control; Sharp pin blade set penetrates meat easily and requires a minimal amount of manual force to punch through the toughest cuts of meat making our tenderizer a must-have kitchen tool that would do a perfect job for years;-High-quality design provides our customers with a professional tenderizer made out of the best materials and top-level precision;-Knife sharp heavy-duty but still thin blades will not get dull or bend even under the toughest cuts of meat and will press the meat without mushing it What Can You Achieve? -With minimal hand force, our tool will tenderize Beef, Pork, Chicken, etc., for a better BBQ, grill and quick Steak Marinade;-No loss of natural juices and reduced shrinkage and cooking time;-Saves money by turning inexpensive cuts into tender, prime cuts of meat Our top priority is delivering high quality product to our customers with 100 % Satisfaction Guarantee . The Premium 48-Blade Meat Tenderizer is backed by our manufacturer 30 day money back guarantee with 1 year free replacement warranty. *Keep out of children reach*","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ClbILpMML._AC_SL1491_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wharph","source_asin":"B07D6FNP64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D6FNP64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D6FNP64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1042504,"name":"Electrolux 1934 12\" Carpet, 5 amp Eureka The Boss Domestic Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QjZBMViiL.jpg","description":"The Electrolux 1934B Eureka The Boss domestic vacuum cleaner is a lightweight (11 lb.) upright vacuum cleaner with a 5 amp motor, an 11-quart dust bag, and a 13\" wide cleaning path. The vacuum collects debris in an 11-quart capacity disposable dust bag for longer uninterrupted vacuuming than models with smaller bags. The height of the vacuum cleaner can be manually adjusted to six positions to accommodate different flooring surfaces. The handle has an automatic locking system with a foot pedal release for usability. The 13\" wide cleaning path provides greater coverage than narrower vacuums. The 20-foot power cord wraps around hooks on the cleaner handle for storage. A furniture guard bumper helps prevent damage to furniture and walls. Specifications Motor power5 ampsCleaning path13\"Cord length20'Capacity11 dry quartsReplacement dust bagEureka F & GWeight11 lb. Vacuum cleaners have electric motors that generate suction to remove dust, dirt, and debris from floors and other surfaces. The dirt is collected in a dust bag (either disposable or reusable), a cyclone, or another chamber for disposal. Intake and exhaust air is usually filtered to keep dust particles from clogging the motor or being released back into the air. HEPA (High Efficiency Particulate Air) and ULPA (Ultra Low Penetration Air) filters are used for applications that require the filtration of very fine particles. Vacuum cleaners are available in a variety of styles, including upright vacuums, canister vacuums, backpack vacuums, and wet and dry vacuums. Vacuum cleaners may have residential, commercial, or industrial applications. Electrolux manufactures kitchen, laundry, and other appliances for consumers and professional users under the brands Eureka!, Frigidaire, and Sanitaire, among others. The company, founded in 1919, is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QjZBMViiL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Electrolux","source_asin":"B004MDM1IU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004MDM1IU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004MDM1IU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
