window.products.push({"id":1042547,"name":"ZebraSmile Decorative Throw Pillow Covers Soft Touch Small Cushion Covers for Sofa Couch Bedroom Car Rest 16\"X 16\" Gingle Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o1vyMBCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MATERIAL】 Our decorative pillow covers are made of pure natural fabric, not microfiber, not polyester, and no soft plush. Those are all chemical fiber materials. We use high-grade cotton and linen, which is very breathable and can be used close to your body. Good cotton and linen will not pilling, you can rub them hard for verification after receiving the goods. Our pillow covers are durable. 【WORKMANSHIP】 Our zipper terminals have been processed twice, and will not be off-line at the zipper like other products. They have fine workmanship, exquisite seaming and superior materials. We are strict with the product quality and pursue details. We use a delicate invisible zipper. Only the details of the zipper sewing area are guaranteed, the pillow cover will still remain as perfect as new whether you replace the pillow core or wash it for many times. 【Rich Options】 We have various colors (dark and lively light) and pecifications. They can be sold individually or combined freely. With high-grade materials, our pillow covers are suitable for all kinds of decorative styles. Even a simple solid color, will make the your pillow look upscale and will not be outdated. 【APPLICATION】 Our solid pillow cover is the perfect cushion cover for sofa, couch, chair, bed, school, travel and naps. Dressing up your bed or couch sofa with these bright color pillow covers, will add a touch of color to your sweet home. 【WASHING】 Our pillow covers are machine washable (below 86 F, gentle cycle, do not bleach). They will not shrink, fade or lint after washing. All the solid-color pillowcases sold on Amazon look the same, actually there are differences. Please recommend them to your friends if our products satisfy you. And please tell us If there is any discrepancy with our description.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o1vyMBCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZebraSmile","source_asin":"B08TVVJP3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TVVJP3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TVVJP3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
