window.products.push({"id":1042553,"name":"6 Cavity Semi Sphere Round Silicone Molds,3 Pc Silicone Baking mold for Making Hot Chocolate Bomb, Cake Pops, Jelly Balls, Puddings, Dome Mousse, Non ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DeqpES6KS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Hot Chocolate Bomb Mold is made of food grade silicon and contain no BPA. It is pack of 3 silicon molds which has 6 medium semi sphere cavity with Piping bag which is used for making Hot Chocolate Bomb, Cake, Jelly, Dome Mousse Making, Hot Cocoa Bomb Ball Mold. Cocoa bomb mold to make unique and amazing cake embellishments, party themes, gifts and more that look as great as they taste. Making Gummy bear with your kids together. Using hard plastic molds and sometimes the mold cracks when you try to get your pieces out. But this silicone molds for hot chocolate bombs won't crack or break like that. You can take out the candy or the chocolate easily. Tips: When you make the cake, please do not pure full cake slurry into the molds, just make it 3/4 full. The cake will expand when making. Put the Semicircular silicone molds in boiling water for 5 minutes before using it for the first time to remove the smell of silicone molds for chocolate bombs itself. When baking, it's better to put the mold in the flat baking tray Please do not use cool water to clean immediately when it's just taken out of the oven. Just to extend the service life. Note: Silicone molds can only be used for oven, microwave ovens, and dishwashers and refrigerators. Do not use in gas and fire. Do not use knives or other sharp tolls on silicone molds and avoid stress, pull. The mold may be stored quite a while and has been pressed down, and shapes changed. Please place it under the sun or place in oven or place in a high temperature. The shape then will be restored. Specification: Non-stick surface and flexible, which are Non-odor which just pop out with pressed finger, easy to release and clean, practicality and durability. Safe to use in ovens, microwave ovens, dishwasher and freezer. Mold Size- L x W / 19 cm x 13 cm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DeqpES6KS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XYZ","source_asin":"B08T4MVS3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T4MVS3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T4MVS3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
