window.products.push({"id":1042622,"name":"Set of 4 Thick Velvet Stretch Armrest Covers Anti-Slip Arm Covers for Chairs and Sofas Armchair Covers for Arms Couch Arm Covers Armrest Covers for So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7177U0QR+qL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Why choose our armrest cover? Superior in quality and crafted with love! We cut no corner in our product. Made from 100% premium polyester, our armrest cover is waterproof and durable. Are you worried that the pet’s hair and dirt will stick to sofa? No need to worry anymore. Our fashionable armrest cover can protect your beloved furniture from scratching, wearing, tearing and stain damage. It will be a good option for the famliy with children or pets. Are you bored with your broken and worn out armrest? Here comes a good news! Refresh your home just a single touch! Takes your leisure experience to a whole new level! A perfect gift for you, friends, lover and your family! So buy it with confidence and begin this amazing journey! How to use twist pins? When installing, screw the sofa clockwise to fix it; in the same way, when disassembling, screw it out counterclockwise to turn the twist pin out. Product Specification Material:polyesterSize: 20.9\"(L) x 4.8”(W) x 9.17”(H) Color: Brick Package Included 4 x armrest cover16 twist pins Warm Notes Machine washable but please separately in cold water on the gentle cycle. Please do not bleach and iron. And to make sure getting the perfect fitting, please measure your funiture before purchasing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7177U0QR+qL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funland","source_asin":"B08Y6RLRJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6RLRJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6RLRJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1042623,"name":"ThreeL Primavera 100% Cotton Duvet Cover Bedding Set Floral (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hC5+mvn8L._AC_SL1239_.jpg","description":"What is a duvet cover?This is not comforter!!! Analogy: duvet is to duvet cover as pillow is to pillowcase. A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, duvet covers are useful because they protect your comforter during use and are easily removed and easy to wash. With duvet covers, you can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate. The duvet should fit snugly inside a duvet cover which can be removed and washed when needed. The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color choice of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover. This allows for easy changes from season to season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hC5+mvn8L._AC_SL1239_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThreeL","source_asin":"B00ZASND8I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1042623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZASND8I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZASND8I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
